{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"747916484977754243","content":"Gold and silver are scarce. Every scrap of it is being used to pay interest to foreign countries on existing loans. What passes for money in the city is a dizzying array of municipal bank notes, IOU's and counterfeit notes. Collectively these are known as \"Gold Notes\". All goods and services can be paid for in these notes, and good luck getting anything but gold notes in when selling goods or treasure.","created_at":"2020-12-24T04:52:04.805000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"791528602831159316","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
