{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"747916484977754243","content":"Corporate espionage runs rampant through the city. You wouldn't know by looking at the clean streets, and park-like atmosphere of the financial district, but just under the surface, a war is raging. As the revolutionaries gear up for fighting redcoats, and as redcoats apply more pressure, shrewd opportunists are licking their chops. Companies WILL fall. Fortunes WILL be made. Rule of law is waning, and power is up for grabs.","created_at":"2020-12-29T02:06:39.276000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"793298911472648273","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"747916484977754243","content":"<@!343605682580488215> <@!629235245291667476> Feedback on your cities material please\n\nStrands of Ley (The City)- These threads are soaked in the leylines that meet in the City, absorbing the ambient magical energy. Robes weaved and leather armors stitched with these threads are able to once per day absorb one spell equal to or less than half your proficiency bonus. You may as an action, on your next turn, redirect the spell at another target per the spell’s rules. Bows and Crossbows strung with the thread count as a spell focus and deal additional force damage equal to your proficiency bonus.","created_at":"2021-02-04T00:34:44.450000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"806684131643752468","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
